:20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n根据赤壁和白帝城的位置计算方位……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n可以推测北面的祭坛在长安一带，\n东面的祭坛在许都附近。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n既然是在长安和许都就可以放心了，\n咱们的人不会看不见他们造祭坛的！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n不过将军，对孔明的计谋不可大意啊。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n主公，属下以为应该即刻派人查探。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n是的，不能再耽搁了！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。\n好吧……贾诩。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n在。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n从这里去长安比许都近。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n我本想即刻派遣大军前去长安，\n不过大军行动似乎过于缓慢。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n你既然熟悉长安一带的地形，\n就率领少数人马赶往长安，\n调查一下祭坛的所在吧！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n是，请主公放心。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n……貂蝉！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n在。"]},{"op":20